{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"dexterous-highborn-antelope","creation_channel":"cli","description":"# RBPROBE-4e21 soft-wrap validation probe\n\n## Context / Problem\n\nThis is a temporary probe ticket created to validate the ADF soft-wrap fix against live Jira. It\ncontains prose that has been deliberately hard-wrapped by the author at a fixed column width so\nthat the reconciler has something to rejoin, and it must arrive in Jira as a single readable\nparagraph rather than as one Jira paragraph per source line.\n\nThis second paragraph exists to prove that blank-line separation between paragraphs survives the\ntransform and is still rendered as real paragraph spacing in Jira.\n\n- first bullet stays on its own line\n- second bullet stays on its own line\n\nDELETE ME: RBPROBE-4e21 probe ticket, safe to remove.","id":"a4d6-d6c4-e269-40e2","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"RBPROBE-4e21 soft-wrap validation probe (DELETE ME)"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785018597931976001,"uuid":"82da3ad4-6382-4cfb-8f90-a2eb5a135a9e"}